<mxCell id="gh_box" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=#EF6C00;fillColor=#F6F8FA;fontColor=#EF6C00;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=6;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2200" y="1680" width="440" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend_l" value="&lt;b style=&#x27;font-size:14px&#x27;&gt;Flows (1/2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#1565C0&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;DNS lookup of eventide.creasy.club (Cloudflare delegates the name to Route 53, which answers with the NLB)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#1565C0&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;HTTPS request — TLS ends at the NLB with the ACM certificate&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#1565C0&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;NLB → ingress-nginx NodePort (the NLB is built by Terraform, not by Kubernetes)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#1565C0&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ingress routes by path: / → web · /api/auth · /api/events · /api/regis (+WebSocket) · /api/payment&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#2E7D32&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;/files/* is rewritten by the ingress straight to S3; only public/* is readable&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#455A64&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;event, registration, payment ask auth to validate the session cookie (get-session, cached in Redis 60 s)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#2E7D32&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;auth, event, registration, payment → RDS (one database, one role, pool of 4 per pod)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#2E7D32&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;same four → Redis (session cache, event cache, live-seat pub/sub)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#2E7D32&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;auth (avatar) and event (cover, gallery, OG reads) write/read S3 with the session credentials&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#C2185B&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;same four enqueue mail (template + props) on SQS&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;fillColor=#FAFAFA;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=6;dashed=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="1960" width="1200" height="235" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend_r" value="&lt;b style=&#x27;font-size:14px&#x27;&gt;Flows (2/2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#C2185B&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;mail-worker long-polls, renders the React Email template, deletes; 5 failed receives → DLQ&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#EF6C00&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;12&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;mail-worker → Gmail SMTP (dry-run log when no App Password)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#EF6C00&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;13&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;payment → Stripe (checkout, verify, refund)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#EF6C00&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;14&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Stripe → webhook, over the public https site (the endpoint registered in Stripe)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#EF6C00&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;15&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;auth → Google (sign-in; on because the site is https)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#455A64&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;16&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;web asks event for the page&#x27;s title / image (Open Graph head)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#6A1B9A&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;17&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;make up/down = terraform apply, state in S3 (permanent: ECR, S3, SQS, secrets, DNS · nightly: EKS, RDS, NLB); make secrets&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#6A1B9A&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;18&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;push to main: build + push images (a), helm upgrade + kubectl + db-migrate (b), read secrets (c)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#6A1B9A&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;19&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kubelet pulls images from ECR; EKS control plane manages the nodes&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#1565C0&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━ user request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#x27;#455A64&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━ service call&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#x27;#2E7D32&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━ data store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#x27;#C2185B&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━ mail (SQS)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#x27;#EF6C00&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━ external API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#6A1B9A&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;┅ deploy / control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#x27;#757575&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;┅ DNS / certificate setup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#x27;#EF6C00&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;▭ orange dashed box = not live yet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;fillColor=#FAFAFA;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=6;dashed=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1470" y="1960" width="1200" height="235" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style=&#x27;font-size:26px&#x27;&gt;Eventide — AWS infrastructure, as built&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=26;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
